Laya typed-decisions (English)
==============================

This model pack contains an ONNX conversion of the Laya System 1 decision model
published by Convai Innovations at:

  https://huggingface.co/convaiinnovations/laya-typed-decisions (repository root checkpoint)
  revision 1a793eb568e6718f15941d08f85432581df534e3

The original model is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

Modifications: the checkpoint was converted to ONNX by the Portable Coding Tool export
script (tools/system-one-export/export_onnx.py). The fp16 variant stores weights in
float16 and the int8 variant uses 8-bit block-wise weight quantization; both were derived from
the fp32 ONNX export. tokenizer.json and rl_agent_config.json are copied unchanged from the
source revision.

This conversion is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or supported by Convai Innovations.
The Laya name is used only to identify the source of the model.
